<title>FRANCE: GTM Entrepose 1996 sales 39.3 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>GTM Entrepose 1996 sales 39.3 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Sales			 39,318     vs	39,658</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    Fourth quarter	    10,106     vs	11,141</p>
<p>NOTE: French construction company GTM published the figures in the Balo official bulletin. It said in a statement the 1995 sales figures had been restated to include the total sales for the year of Dumez-GTM, but excluded sales by Wiemer und Trachte. GTM is 48-percent owned by Lyonnaise des Eaux.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
